      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Each record in the search were included if they met all of the following criteria: (1) Were scientific peer-reviewed journals written in English; (2) Were published before 30th June 2024; (3) Studies were included irrespective of the targeted geographical regions; (4) Studies were included irrespective of the population subgroups; (5) Studies containing an optimization model (mathematical or statistical); (6) All studies with human Plasmodium species; (7) Studies with two or more interventions; (8) Cost data were used in combination with the model outputs; (9) Outcomes/health benefits were clearly stated and/or measured.",
      "reason": "The inclusion criteria specify several eligibility characteristics (e.g., optimization model type, human Plasmodium, interventions, cost data usage, outcomes/health benefits). However, they do not clearly specify eligible study designs, settings, or follow-up requirements as described by the criterion."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Each record in the search were included if they met all of the following criteria: (1) Were scientific peer-reviewed journals written in English; (2) Were published before 30th June 2024;",
      "reason": "The criteria specify dissemination year (published before 30th June 2024) and language (written in English) and indicate publication type (scientific peer-reviewed journals). The evidence does not explicitly state eligibility criteria for publication/report status beyond that (e.g., whether unpublished reports were eligible)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence was provided describing whether the review distinguishes exclusion due to outcomes not measured versus outcomes results not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "Although the review mentions that a narrative synthesis was performed, the provided evidence does not specify the groups used in each synthesis or link them to comparisons defined in the review objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The provided evidence lists inclusion/exclusion criteria but does not provide rationales for any notable restrictions on study eligibility."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 62
